# CareerForge AI — environment variables

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. **Never commit `.env`.**

## Required — all environments

```bash
# Application
CAREERFORGE_ENVIRONMENT=development      # development | staging | production
CAREERFORGE_DEBUG=false                  # enable uvicorn reload + verbose logging

# CORS — explicit allowlist, never wildcard in production
CAREERFORGE_CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000"]

# PostgreSQL (uses asyncpg driver)
CAREERFORGE_DB_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://careerforge:password@localhost:5432/careerforge

# Redis (broker + result backend for Celery)
CAREERFORGE_REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# JWT
CAREERFORGE_JWT_SECRET=change-me-in-production-please
CAREERFORGE_ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60
CAREERFORGE_REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# Email (transactional)
CAREERFORGE_EMAIL_PROVIDER=resend
CAREERFORGE_EMAIL_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CAREERFORGE_EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=noreply@careerforge.ai
CAREERFORGE_EMAIL_FROM_NAME=CareerForge AI
```

## LLM providers — platform default keys (optional)

If these are set the platform can bill users for LLM usage. Otherwise set
`CAREERFORGE_DEFAULT_LLM_PROVIDER=ollama` for local-only dev.

```bash
CAREERFORGE_DEFAULT_LLM_PROVIDER=openai
CAREERFORGE_DEFAULT_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
CAREERFORGE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CAREERFORGE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```

## BYOK encryption — KMS key id (production only)

```bash
CAREERFORGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY_ID=arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:123456789:key/abc-123
```

## S3 / MinIO — document storage

For local dev with MinIO, uncomment and adjust:

```bash
CAREERFORGE_S3_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:9000
CAREERFORGE_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=minioadmin
CAREERFORGE_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin
CAREERFORGE_S3_BUCKET_NAME=careerforge-documents
CAREERFORGE_S3_REGION=us-east-1
```

## Stripe (production)

```bash
CAREERFORGE_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CAREERFORGE_STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
CAREERFORGE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```

## Optional toggles

```bash
# pg8000 fallback (pure-Python driver) — only needed if asyncpg unavailable
# CAREERFORGE_DB_URL=postgresql+pg8000://…

# Override log level at runtime
# CAREERFORGE_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
```
